<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - P.H.Glatfelter said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - P.H.Glatfelter said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns raised its rating of P.H. Glatfelter Co on Friday to attractive from its previous rating of neutral, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- P.H. Glatfelter shares closed at 17-1/8 on Thursday.</p>
</text>
